message: "If you use AdPilot, please cite it as below."
title: "AdPilot: an AI analyst for ad spend"
abstract: >-
  An AI analyst for ad spend. Plain-English questions become checked, read-only SQL, an answer and a chart, over
  BigQuery or DuckDB. Includes a daily brief, a Streamlit dashboard, a FastAPI service, an MCP server and a nightly
  eval of free models.
type: software
